{"agent":"te2-kilo","data":{"by":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"In `test_a_repeat_of_a_closed_finding_is_the_same_id`, `parse(...)` returns a tuple/list whose first element is the list of findings and whose second element is the boolean `on_contract` flag (as evidenced by line 56: `findings, on_contract = parse(...)`). Therefore, `parse(...)[0]` evaluates to the list of findings, not a single finding object, so indexing it again with `[0]` (`first[0]`) raises an `IndexError: list index out of range` or `TypeError` because it attempts to index the finding object (or fails when `parse(...)[0]` is empty if it returns the list). This breaks the test suite when executed.","digest":"a67a3410132031a9","family":"google","location":"tests/test_review_contract_doc.py:38","malformed":"","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","severity":"HIGH","title":"tests/test_review_contract_doc.py:38"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":5258,"diff_sha":"3e6b955afd8cb07f11f26fc4aa6631c1ace77fae4e8f239fff41cd710a2dc6bd","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/TE-review-economy","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":52.5,"family":"google","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","output_digest":"894eb320427268d5","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/TE-review-economy.critic.grok-4.7.20261111T110458Z-bca37400.jsonl","passed_on_refutation":{"confirmed":2,"max_rounds":6,"refuted":1,"rounds":4},"reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"bcc881ba666b9bc0f6f9a8c5c8be4aca33996929","reviewed_paths":{"docs/ddflow/drivers/review-contract.md":"100644 470e51d507fd507a588f1b71c00dd9bc5bf5a725","tests/test_review_contract_doc.py":"100644 1a2dcf9e0d9a43e8c4212967022727e92e351bb0"},"reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reviewer_digest":"c7d1b7506be569ee","reviewer_families":["googl